{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6fbd7f18d467cbfe695d9761b037a8b154c0a6d67937c0b939b1a2b15eec3d99", "ja": "（いろいろ大変だったが、茜の初公演は成功した。\n茜もきっと、成長したはずだ）", "zh": "（虽然有种种波折，茜的首次公演还是办得很成功。\n茜肯定也有所成长吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8095b029ceb834f59c7cea3fa9d6e3e165333d0c6a27314e2a4e46a1fd4d474d", "ja": "（さて、そんな茜をこれから\nどう売り出していけばいいのか……）", "zh": "（那么，今后要如何捧红成长后的茜呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "6de0596ab6dddcdbcebe2b76760be808f49ed1f0bcb26f7cbe85d53ecffe8b52", "ja": "さて、こんな茜ちゃんをこれから\nどう売り出していけばいいのか……。", "zh": "那么，今后要如何捧红成长后的小茜呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2eee14a90b78fa840406a9a6f51053690a0ead00341dac886ca5b0520a87605f", "ja": "そう、それについて……いや、待て待て待て待て！\nそれは茜が考えることじゃないぞ！", "zh": "对，关于这一点……不，慢着慢着慢着慢着！\n这不是你该思考的事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4113962af5e9b9264d7c08f882a2c11f685bcbf785868f481be1bf2cbcc791b4", "ja": "あくまでも茜はアイドルで、\nプロデュースは、俺の仕事だからな？", "zh": "再怎么说你都是个偶像，\n培育是属于我的工作喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "8476b6391724c855a9aa40252ad4d90b847ce5feaf542fec5ee38a877cba586b", "ja": "え～？　だって{$P$}ちゃんの\nプロデュースって、地道でマジメで堅実なんだもん。", "zh": "咦～？谁叫小{$P$}的培育，\n很脚踏实地、认真又稳健嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c9938172eaebde3f2536c5f9c2ee3ac4be0544ea8fb811433cd1be3a6639273e", "ja": "それのどこが悪いっていうんだ……。", "zh": "那有什么不好……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "f0d7be4feef5aded7d5d05fe42893503d7c74cf227db2c3ad4b1137877ee8ad3", "ja": "茜ちゃんには、もっとパパっと、楽ちんにトップ\nアイドルになれるプロデュースをしてほしいな～。", "zh": "小茜希望采取那种可以快速、\n轻松成为顶尖偶像的培育方式～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_1008", "source_sha256": "59839d517126262b52d1993839ba026345ff82aca91e7c077940ee4ac7a9a67a", "ja": "現実の厳しさを教える", "zh": "告诉她现实的残酷", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_2000_p", "source_sha256": "1db8121d3698589c3c87befd327b8cd46de7a35bd994018feea5cbb646b0200c", "ja": "……あのな。初公演を成功させたぐらいで、\n調子に乗るんじゃない。現実は厳しいんだぞ？", "zh": "……我说啊，别因为首次公演成功就得意忘形，\n现实是很残酷的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_2001_023aka", "source_sha256": "196d98e4843b669d7f41c8945117d90cbc994eed445c4e45f30c4eb1797faf5b", "ja": "え～？　それは、{$P$}ちゃんが\nそう思ってるだけじゃない？", "zh": "咦～？\n纯粹是小{$P$}这样觉得而已吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_2002_023aka", "source_sha256": "423f87a4f4f49c2d87669ba000a647f53ac74f49ac0b70e98d42f56923bbd84b", "ja": "それとも……\n{$P$}ちゃんの現実は厳しいの？", "zh": "还是说……\n现实对小{$P$}来说很残酷呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_2003_023aka", "source_sha256": "cb06acd222c34796257008791d13bfea076c93e42a4c95ea408c8b058f2627a5", "ja": "うんうん、オトナになるってつらいことなんだね。\n茜ちゃんがなぐさめてあげるよ。よしよし～♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，成为大人是很痛苦的事情呢，\n小茜来安慰你吧，乖乖～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_2004_p", "source_sha256": "ba55ad85121f2283a547ee7e371f785f1f8fbadadca21cc5a477e177a9623d4a", "ja": "（くっ、ああ言えばこう言う……！）", "zh": "（唔，竟然跟我顶嘴……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_2005_023aka", "source_sha256": "e231d53c3dacb6bace4ada618bc9c95f007fec86e0ef1fdd7ef2a3c3ea8b1ee3", "ja": "それに引き換え、茜ちゃんの現実はやさしいよ～？\nチュートリアルくらいの、超イージーモードだよ☆", "zh": "小茜跟你相反，现实对小茜来说温柔得很呢～！\n大概就新手教学的难度，是超简单模式喔☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_2006_023aka", "source_sha256": "29038775479287536b95394ae1f0a11a7799ee6726395b26f56c5078341a3cd0", "ja": "それに、茜ちゃんの夢だって、\nあっさり実現しちゃったもんね！", "zh": "而且小茜的梦想也很轻易就实现了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_2007_p", "source_sha256": "dd9ba49e5a7ba9f76e8190a881db342cfb93b18dd4d1d47c84f0d97382e191bd", "ja": "夢が実現……？　なんのことだ？", "zh": "实现梦想……？你指的是什么事情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_2008_023aka", "source_sha256": "035bd81fcd027aee1682d64a0605f1483d0b18272692005dff5f8e7364a99dfc", "ja": "あり？　茜ちゃん、\n{$P$}ちゃんに言ってなかったっけ？", "zh": "咦？\n小茜没有告诉小{$P$}吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_2009_p", "source_sha256": "c3f3962e0b4c1e4fdb839771a86a225a45df850789ab24474ffa902454edca11", "ja": "何も聞いてないかな……。\nというか、茜の夢ってなんだ？", "zh": "我好像没听你说过……\n所以你的梦想是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_2010_023aka", "source_sha256": "12101d7ac45b5f5d649ee7252448bbfcea67430dfcfcd212e1596746e89aad28", "ja": "もっちろん！　アイドルになることだよ！", "zh": "当然是成为偶像啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_2011_023aka", "source_sha256": "e9d15ee9c79a16f3cfc0bcd24543880ef9988bb9677870b5377370a845a538ab", "ja": "茜ちゃん、アイドルになるのが夢だったんだ～。\nちっちゃいころから、ずーっとあこがれてたの！", "zh": "小茜的梦想就是成为偶像～\n而且从小就一直很向往呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_2012_023aka", "source_sha256": "72c719e159cab0f5218426e3b551a01eb7e1a433a9eece8f6a0036d7792cb4db", "ja": "子供のころからアイドルになりたかった茜ちゃんが！\n{$P$}ちゃんと出会ってアイドルに！", "zh": "小时候就想成为偶像的小茜！\n在遇见小{$P$}后成为了偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_2013_023aka", "source_sha256": "9eb2a4135c0375404647d473de7e38a2818f871ee19d46469da4d70e7271dfb9", "ja": "ほらね、夢は叶うでしょ？\nだからきっと、トップアイドルになる夢も叶うって！", "zh": "你看，梦想是会实现的呀！\n所以成为顶尖偶像的梦想也一定会实现啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_2014_p", "source_sha256": "ceb47b3f4bd2f5a7a60347b83c3be031fd2f919ed61b03c8f0d49019f6219c73", "ja": "そうだったのか……。\n茜も、ちゃんとアイドルを目指していたんだな。", "zh": "这样啊……\n原来你也是认真想成为偶像的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_2015_023aka", "source_sha256": "603bf19ef46be8226f9c8ee273a23465ecbbf3febdc408cbccef107280204312", "ja": "うんうん、目指してた目指してた！　というか、\n世間が茜ちゃんを放っておくはずがないけどね！", "zh": "嗯嗯，没错没错！\n应该说，大众怎么舍得让小茜埋没呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_2016_p", "source_sha256": "8a7a86f36fedbcd546e423f42b3d034811929b6492e53b7bcc8277733d20f883", "ja": "うん、そういうのはいいから。\n……しかし、そうか……。", "zh": "嗯，这种话就不必了。\n……不过，原来如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_004_2017_p", "source_sha256": "77dabcc479a4435df0bbe3c6bd2694e4c3f8d7a0f8c9cd40df5f0654196df104", "ja": "（考えが甘いところもあるが、ちゃんと夢に向かって\nいるんだな。……頑張ってプロデュースしていこう！）", "zh": "（想法确实有些天真，但她是认真在朝梦想迈进。\n……我就努力培育她吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
